<title>JAPAN: Furukawa Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Furukawa Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		258.08		vs	  255.64</p>
<p> Operating	    1.28		vs	    1.05</p>
<p> Current		3.28		vs	  221    million</p>
<p> Net		    2.08		vs	  164    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.17 yen	  vs	    0.25 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    656 million	  vs	 656 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Furukawa Electric Co Ltd is a major electric wire and cable maker.</p>
</text>
